  "note": "RBI, Pattern of major capital receipts of the state governments (DBIE report 453; Handbook of Statistics on the Indian Economy). Amounts in ₹ crore (DBIE serves rupees). From 1999-2000 the states' share of small savings is shown as special securities issued to the NSSF, not as loans from the Centre (Handbook note 6). Stages, from the printed table's own note: accounts to 2023-24, the revised estimate for 2024-25 and the budget estimate for 2025-26, each in its own series (suffix __re and __be), never one line. Cross-checked against the printed table (Innovation Hub export of Handbook report 211): 305 of 305 figures match."
